      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Similarly, because a URL with a redirect is inserted into the OGP image, it is highly likely that the image will not be displayed correctly on some websites. The link should be set in the meta tag from the beginning so that the MIME type is image/png.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
